  {"exam_type":"jamb","subject":"Mathematics","topic":"Variation","year":2026,"question":"If y varies inversely as x² and y = 8 when x = 2, find y when x = 4.","options":["1","2","4","16"],"answer":"2","explanation":"yx² = k. k = 8×4 = 32. When x = 4, y = 32/16 = 2."},
